  "findings": [
    "lifecycle CLI has no init/home/state-root/settings resolver",
    "_owner_path hashes ROOT, not hostname/port; port selects owner filename",
    "manager --root defaults to checkout and does not read SM root ENV; loader/lifecycle do",
    "materializer BUNDLE_BASE and manager input-bundle discovery remain checkout-local",
    "Watchlist/control ENV seams exist with checkout defaults",
    "L2 explicit caller members and forbidden roots; no automatic installation discovery",
    "product_version reads tracked VERSION without Git",
    "L1/L4 timing/diagnostics/path/resource policies are reused, not replaced"
  ]
